            "review_title": "Review at Sea Food Be Ni 2 Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Reslimpan\nRayong, Thailand4155 contributions\n0\nSuper fresh and tasty seafood\nDec 2025 • Family\nSeafood galore near My Khe Beach. No beach or ocean view despite the location, but that’s easy to overlook once the food starts coming. You can choose your seafood straight from the tanks or go for one of the combo platters and ask them to prepare anyway you like it. The crab and grouper were both excellent. This would have been a solid five-star visit if it weren’t for the pretty awful butter sauce that came with the snails. Worth noting that this is very much a family-style place, with dishes meant for sharing.\nRead more\nWritten December 23, 2025",
